quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;color:#333;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;Obrigatório para Realizada; deve ser ≥ data_hora_inicio.&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;color:#333;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;Classe Consulta; RF03&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;color:#1f2937;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;motivo_cancelamento&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;color:#444;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;TEXT&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#b26a00;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Condicional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;color:#333;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;Texto livre até 500 caracteres&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;color:#333;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;Obrigatório quando status = Cancelada; registrar prazo para RN01.&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;color:#333;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;UC Cancelar/Desmarcar consulta; RN01&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;color:#1f2937;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;criado_em&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;color:#444;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;TIMESTAMP&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#2d6a2d;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Sim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;color:#333;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;Data e hora&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;color:#333;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;NOT NULL; DEFAULT now(); auditoria.&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;color:#333;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;Requisito de auditoria; Modelo de Persistência&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;color:#1f2937;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;atualizado_em&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10px;color:#444;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;TIMESTAMP&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#777777;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Não&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;color:#333;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;Data e hora&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;color:#333;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;Atualizado em cada alteração; auditoria.&lt;/td&gt;     &lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8edf3;font-size:10px;color:#333;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word;&quot;&gt;Requisito de auditoria; Modelo de Persistência&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=0;spacingTop=0;shadow=0;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1">
